    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d179-a4">

                <pb facs="0325" n="319" sameAs="frus:frus1901China/pg319"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Annex No</hi>. 2.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-06-09">June 9, 1901</date>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">IMPERIAL EDICT of the 9th of June,
                        1901</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">translation</hi>).</p>
                <p>“We confer on Tsai Feng, Prince Ch’ün of the first rank, the title of Ambassador
                    extraordinary, and We direct him to proceed to Germany to respectfully discharge
                    the mission which We confide to him.</p>
                <p>“Chang Yi, reader of the Grand Chancellery, and Yin Ch’ang, military
                    Lieutenant-Governor, shall accompany him as secretaries.</p>
                <p>“Respect this!”</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#italic">Correct copy</hi>. <lb/><signed><list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. d’Anthouard.</hi></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">B. Kroupensky.</hi></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reginald Tower.</hi></item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">G. Bohlen-Halbach.</hi></item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
